# TN Council of Ministers government desk

Read **`.cursor/plans/tn-council-of-ministers.plan.md`** before adding routes or copy.

Non-negotiables:

- **Roster source of truth:** `src/content/government/ministers-may-2026.ts` — update on reshuffle with Lok Bhavan PDF.
- **Hybrid model:** evergreen `/guides/tn-council-of-ministers/*` + dated `/chennai-local-news/*` seeds.
- **Disclaimer + AI fine print** on every public page (`GuideDisclaimer kind="civic"`).
- **Bilingual** = EN hub + `-tamil` twin + `hreflang`. Do not mix languages on one URL.
- **No fake Person JSON-LD** for ministers in v1.
- **Self-host** Lok Bhavan PDFs under `public/documents/`.
- Canonical host **https://mychennaicity.in** only.
